OL,4,CNext halts baby sleeping bag         W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GSales of a baby sleeping bag have    W5
OL,7,Gbeen halted in the UK by fashion     W5
OL,8,Gretail chain Next, after a new mum   W5
OL,9,Graised the alarm over its safety.    W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GEmma Hunter, 29 from Norwich,        W5
OL,12,Gcontacted BBC Your Voice to say she  W5
OL,13,Grealised the neck hole was far too   W5
OL,14,Gbig - meaning her daughter Rosie     W5
OL,15,Gcould potentially wriggle down,      W5
OL,16,Gburying her face and risking         W5
OL,17,Gsuffocation.                         W5
OL,18,                                      W5
OL,19,GEmma recalls: "I woke up my husband  W5
OL,20,Gand we both agreed there was no way  W5
OL,21,Gwe could put Rosie in it."           W5
